        "kind": "agent",
        "text": "# Retry\n\n## What changed\n\nThe retry now waits for the **paste to land** before pressing Return, and gives up after *three* tries. See `send.rs` and [the earlier fix](https://github.com/example/widgets/pull/12).\n\n### Steps\n\n1. Read the tab's mark.\n2. Paste, then check the box holds the text.\n3. Press Return.\n\n- A paste that didn't land is typed again.\n- One that landed twice is cleared first.\n\n> Messages to one session arrive in the order you sent them.\n\n```bash\ncargo test send -- --nocapture\n```\n\n```ts\nexport function waitingAfter(list: string[], key: string): string | null {\n  return list[list.indexOf(key) + 1] ?? null;\n}\n```\n\n| Route | Waits | Tries |\n| :--- | :-: | ---: |\n| Typed | 2 s | 3 |\n| Socket | none | 1 |\n\n---\n\n#### Left for later\n\nNothing here stops a turn that is already running.",
